				 	 In-Person Early Voting for the State Election Begins Oct 17th at Town Hall  
 
In-person early voting for the November 3rd State election begins on Saturday, October 17th, and runs until Friday, October 30th (excluding Sundays). All in-person early voting takes place at the Town Clerk's office in Town Hall.				 Read on... 
 

			 
			 

				 	 November 3rd State Election Ballots Have Been Mailed!  
 
The Town Clerk's office has mailed over 4,100 ballots to voters who requested them. Please allow the post office time to deliver the ballots to your mailbox.				 Read on... 
 

			 
					 
				 
	 

